WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.550
The Fierce Attack of Kurata's Army

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.550
Protect the Holy Capital

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.770
The Fierce Attack of Kurata's Army!

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.550
Protect the Holy Capital!

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.890
The battle has begun.

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.800
To protect the Holy Capital, ElDoradimon,

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:21.130
Masaru and the others challenged Kurata and his Gizmon army to a final battle.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:26.060
Although they knew it was a trap, both Masaru and Ikuto headed for Akatsuki Hill where Kurata waited for them.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:30.380
Meanwhile, Tohma and Nanami fought in a battle of wits,

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.100
which Tohma won, thanks to a flash of insight.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:39.450
However, in Nanami's last act of resistance, the lake was destroyed.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:45.040
Losing its protection, Kurata's evil hand draws near the Holy Capital.

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.900
Damn, they're persistent.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.920
There's just no end to them.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.260
Good work so far.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.570
Masaru!

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.140
Over here!

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:10.050
Come!

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.150
Damn it, why is the water receding?!

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:16.540
I don't know.

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:20.990
But with the water gone, ElDoradimon is left wide open to attack!

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:22.490
Should we go back, Aniki?

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:25.810
No.

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.530
I left Tohma to protect ElDoradimon.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:29.550
It'll be okay.

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:31.520
Let's hurry to where Kurata is!

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:04.810
H-Here they come!

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:06.080
There's too many of them!

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:09.460
I didn't think they would drain the water...

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.310
Now ElDoradimon is...!

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:12.790
Calm down.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:14.540
Yushima-dono!

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:20.050
Keep the Baby Digimon within the palace while the rest of you act as defense!

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.970
If we keep wavering and getting ready to flee, then we can't win a fight that we can win!

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:26.110
A fight... we can win?

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:27.260
That's right!

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:29.920
We have our savior's son on our side!

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:32.590
We must keep standing until he's gotten us our victory!

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:33.400
Yeah!

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:33.400
Yeah!

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.020
Charge, troops!

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:42.750
Let's go!

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:05.170
Digisoul Charge!

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.870
Kamemon, evolve!

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.500
Gawappamon, yeah!

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:15.640
Gawappunch!

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:20.790
Yeah~!

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.720
Lalamon, out of the way!

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:44.120
Thank y-...

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.560
I'm saved...

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:52.730
Yoshino, you're amazing!

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:55.590
You took down a Gizmon:XT!

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:56.660
Thanks.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:58.780
Oh no!

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:00.600
They've crashed into one of the sidewalls!

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.620
Where's the enemy?

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:06.880
Let's go around to the front!

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:07.880
Okay!

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:11.330
I've found you, my beloved honey.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:12.890
Huh?

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.010
"Honey?!"

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:17.040
I'm getting a bad feeling about this...

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:20.620
Our destined reunion ends up on the battlefield.

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:23.010
But right now, we are enemies.

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.740
"I love you..."

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.280
is something I can never say out loud.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.830
Those words...

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.350
I knew it was you...

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:30.650
Ivan!

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.230
How did you know it was me?!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.420
I get it.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:39.560
You must have been longing for me inside your heart just as much as I'm longing for you.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:41.540
Yeah right, me longing for you?

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:45.340
You're the only man around here who says everything he's thinking out loud!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.530
Wh-What?!

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.580
S-So that means,

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:52.510
you know all about the passionate feelings for you that I've been hiding inside of me?!

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:54.220
Oh, this is so embarrassing!

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.130
If there was a hole around, I'd crawl into it right now!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.800
You're not even trying to hide them, are you?

00:04:58.800 --> 00:04:59.610
Darn it!

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.380
In that case, I have no choice!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.650
So that I can earn the privilege of dating you...

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:04.880
Fight me, Honey!

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.870
What do you mean, you have no choice?

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.300
I accept your challenge!

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:12.930
But if I win, you're not allowed to go near Yoshino ever again!

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.830
I'll win and go out with Honey!

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.890
You better run now while you still have the chance!

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:24.160
Once you see my evolved form, you're gonna pass out from a squirting nosebleed!

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.400
Just a second, Lalamon!

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.140
Why are you accepting the match?!

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:29.230
What'll happen if something goes wrong?!

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:31.620
Wait, wait, listen to me first, Yoshino!

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:35.260
Chances are, he's the one who's commanding the troops.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.280
So, you're saying,

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:40.280
if we keep Ivan occupied, the Gizmon's attacks will weaken?

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.890
We can't just keep him occupied.

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:45.430
We've got to knock him down so he'll never do anything bad ever again!

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:46.470
All right.

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:47.590
Let's go, Lalamon.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.080
Digisoul Charge!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.200
Overdrive!

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:56.470
Lalamon, evolve!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.370
Rosemon!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.170
Now that I have the power of the Ultimate Level,

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:24.210
Ivan is no match for me.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.180
I wonder if that's so.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:29.510
That light...

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:36.520
Hyper Bio Extra Evolution!

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:52.650
BioSpinomon!

00:06:53.740 --> 00:07:03.500
BioSpinomon

00:06:53.740 --> 00:07:03.500
Ultimate Level

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.530
BioSpinomon.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:58.680
A Bio Hybrid type formed from the fusion of a human and a Digimon.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.740
His special attack is Blue Prominence.

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:03.500
He can burn everything with one blast of his fireball.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.250
What is that?

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.960
His form is different from before!

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:10.940
Just like you've evolved to the Ultimate Level,

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:14.470
I've been reborn from the new power that Kurata has given me!

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:16.530
Yours is just a fake anyway.

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:17.660
Let's do this, Rosemon.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:18.430
Yes.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:24.180
I'll show you that size is no indication of strength!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:26.510
Take this!

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:32.700
You're equal in power!

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:34.990
This guy...

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.620
How's that?

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:42.790
Compared to Stegomon, my speed is ten times faster, my power is 100 times greater, and...!

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:45.960
My love for Honey is infinite!

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:51.420
I will definitely win this battle and make you my lover, Honey!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.060
I absolutely refuse.

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:56.880
Your cold words only prove the love that you secretly feel for me.

00:08:56.880 --> 00:09:00.830
I will now release your heart from the suffering it's enduring!

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:03.690
Feel the force of my feelings within...

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:06.330
My "I-want-to-walk-arm-in-arm-throughout-the-city Attack!"

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:08.040
What a stupid name!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:13.900
I-want-to-go-boating-together-in-the-park's-pond Crush!

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:21.680
I-want-to-share-a-juice-drink-with-two-straws Bomber!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:22.990
I won't lose!

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:28.460
Not bad.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:29.800
Of course.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:32.190
This is all so I can get Honey and have a loving relationship with her.

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:34.060
Give me a break!

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:35.830
I'll never walk arm-in-arm with you!

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:37.000
Or go on a boat!

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.690
And drink your juice by yourself!

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:40.030
Don't worry.

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.230
I'll never hand you over to him, Yoshino.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:44.080
Now, come on!

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.900
What... are you two doing?

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.420
Master!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.300
The Holy Capital is being attacked!

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.210
Will you be heading back to the Capital now?

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:02.680
Or will you join up with Masaru to deal with Kurata?

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:03.260
Master?

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:04.420
Master!

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:13.780
<i>I...</i>

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.190
<i>I haven't lost to you...</i>

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:20.630
<i>Because... What you used was Daimon Masaru's power...</i>

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.360
Master!

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:24.460
No.

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:27.110
Masaru said he'll be fine on his own.

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:29.570
Let's hurry back to Yushima and the others.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:31.540
Yes, Master.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:45.010
No, don't come out here!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.020
Yoshino?

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:53.970
Rosemon!

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:57.390
You're finished.

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:00.360
Oh no!

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:00.990
Stay back!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.940
Take this!

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:05.800
Out of my way!

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:15.420
P-P-Please, spare me!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:16.840
Ivan, don't!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.060
How could you...?

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.350
You're despicable...

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.850
How can you still regard yourself as a human being?!

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.190
Despicable?!

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.810
This is merely business!

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:36.200
Business?

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.630
Yes.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.020
I was hired by Kurata for money.

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:46.240
In exchange for money, I offered my body to Kurata's will.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:51.320
And he gave me the strongest body that is most efficient for hunting Digimon!

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:56.230
It is my duty to obey Kurata's orders.

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:59.210
Hunting for Digimon is my business!

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.720
This is the worst.

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:08.890
Reporting in.

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:10.350
Professor Kurata,

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.930
only five minutes left until the operation is complete.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:15.060
Everything is going well.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:19.770
Now, it won't be long before the greatest chapter in the history of mankind begins!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.240
What do you mean, "business?"

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:26.410
Digimon are living beings, too!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:31.910
They're just like us humans! We can connect emotionally and even become friends!

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:35.780
Yet you fused with their power to use it for your own advantage...

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:37.880
and you kill Digimon without even a second thought!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:41.220
That doesn't upset you?

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:44.160
Do you not feel anything from seeing the pain and suffering...

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:46.430
of the Digimon that you've hurt?

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:49.720
Having a heart is unnecessary for business, Honey.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:54.180
Don't call me your honey!

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:57.120
I won't ask you to understand.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:01.650
But I will carry out the orders that Kurata gives me without complaint.

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:04.490
This is the contract that I voluntarily sought after!

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:06.860
It's not just your body...

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:10.680
You even sold your heart to Kurata.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.020
Rosemon, defeat Ivan!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.790
Ivan, prepare yourself!

00:13:18.050 --> 00:13:19.110
Don't look down on me!

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:22.240
Roses Rapier!

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:25.970
Ivy Hug!

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:31.650
Forbidden Temptation!

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:43.210
Someone who's given up his heart has no right to speak of love.

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:50.740
You're still...!

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:55.070
I have a reason for carrying through with this mission.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:14:00.450
For that, I will give him my body, my heart...

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:01.880
Everything I possess!

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:06.180
Blue Prominence!

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:18.280
Rosemon!

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:19.520
Rosemon, hang in there!

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:21.650
I'm okay...

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.160
It wasn't a direct hit...

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:25.650
Don't worry.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:28.050
The next one will be.

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:30.030
Yoshino, run...

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:31.310
What are you saying?

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:32.530
Stand up, Rosemon!

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:36.260
We can't afford to lose here!

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:37.700
Yoshino...

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:39.020
You're right.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.350
I can still do this...

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:41.170
Farewell.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:46.320
Blue Prominence!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:52.310
Forbidden Temptation!

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:04.380
We can't lose...

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.400
I won't...

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.070
I won't let you kill anyone anymore!!

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:10.030
What?!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.400
BioSpinomon's signal is gone!

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.320
Huh, Ivan-san lost?

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:24.750
I put my hopes on the wrong man.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:25.910
Kurata!

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:31.740
Here's revenge for Yukidarumon and Mercurimon!

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:33.930
Uchitake Otoshi!

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.170
I won't let you!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.430
Falcomon!

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:38.510
Who's that?!

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:42.450
I got sick of waiting for ya, Daimon Masaru!

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:43.650
You again?!

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:46.860
I started thinking you might've gotten scared and run off.

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:48.320
That's how frickin' long you took!

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:49.570
Cut the crap!

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:06.890
Ivan...

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:17.300
This is...

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:20.810
Give it back...

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:23.570
Ivan!

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:26.660
My picture of my siblings...

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.940
Give it back!

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:31.330
Your siblings?

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:37.600
<i>I have a reason for carrying through with this mission.</i>

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:41.040
Don't tell me... you...

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:43.530
For these children...?

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.350
Ivan, you idiot!

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:54.210
You gave up both your body and heart for money!

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:57.070
Do you really think your family will be happy about that?!

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.580
He takes advantage of other people's weaknesses...

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:11.030
and makes them do things like this...

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:14.360
I'll never forgive Kurata for this.

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:18.440
Are they retreating?

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:20.200
They're stopping their attack...

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.080
But why?!

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:23.300
Stop, MirageGaogamon.

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:24.490
Yes, Master.

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:27.290
The Gizmon are stepping away from ElDoradimon...

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:33.420
What are you doing over there?!

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:40.550
This is...

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:43.010
A space-time oscillation bomb!

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:45.140
Are you okay, Falcomon?

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.490
Ikuto, give me power!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:50.900
Digisoul...

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:56.630
Full Charge!

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:01.870
Falcomon, evolve!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:18.980
Yatagaramon!

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:23.510
You're getting annoying, you shitty crow!

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.060
Yatagaramon!

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:29.670
Just who is he?!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.440
It's almost time.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:32.650
What?

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.200
It's showtime!

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:39.280
What's that?

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:41.280
What's going on?

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.370
What's that?

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:52.300
Ikuto, bad news!

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:54.070
ElDoradimon is sinking!

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:54.960
What?

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.000
Kurata!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:18:59.860
Goodbye!

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.100
A Digital Gate!

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:07.500
That Kurata...

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:10.320
He's trying to send ElDoradimon to the human world!

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:12.020
Just what is he plotting?

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:13.770
Damn it!

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.450
You're dead.

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:23.810
